{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47434","headline":"兰谿灵瑞观 · 舒道纪","name":"兰谿灵瑞观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"澄心坐清境，虚白生林端。\n夜静笑声出，月明松影寒。\n绦霞封药竈，碧窦溅斋坛。\n海树几回老，先生棊未残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"舒道纪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}